    {
      "id": 484952,
      "username": "khoa-l",
      "name": "khoa",
      "created_at": "2025-10-27T06:24:23.415Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi! Thank you for your response, my <strong>System Settings</strong>  are found in <strong>ERPNextSettings</strong>. Are these the same settings you’re referring to?</p>\n<p>There doesn’t seem to be a General Section or a corresponding Default App under General. There <em>is</em> a Default App under the <strong>App</strong> tab however, that only has preset dropdown options none of which are <strong>frappe</strong> or <strong>desk</strong>.</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/khoa-l/{size}/91254_2.png",
      "trust_level": 1,
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
