    {
      "id": 484956,
      "username": "vishnurajesh8",
      "name": "Vishnurajesh8",
      "created_at": "2025-10-27T06:43:23.981Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes, that’s correct in newer versions, System Settings has been replaced by ERPNext Settings. The Default App dropdown only shows installed apps that define their own homepage, which is why frappe or desk don’t appear there. You can fix this by running</p>\n<p><code>bench set-config default_app frappe</code>,</p>\n<p><code>bench clear-cache</code> and</p>\n<p><code>bench restart</code> to make it redirect to the Desk instead.</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/vishnurajesh8/{size}/85081_2.png",
      "trust_level": 1,
      "post_number": 4,
