      "name": "khoa",
      "created_at": "2025-10-27T08:15:29.159Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Some added details! I think this only happens on the Admin account and not on the normal Guest account. I’m still not sure how the pre-generated accounts work. I understand the roles, but it seems a little confusing when each of the pre-generated accounts are logged into.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/t/what-are-the-differences-between-the-pre-generated-accounts/156038\">I made a different topic for the accounts question.</a></p>\n<p>When I log into the site normally and not via the <strong>Login As Administrator</strong> button then it does redirect to the desk properly, but logging in as an Admin sends me to ERPNext. This isn’t consistent however as sometimes logging in via the site normally still sends me to ERPNext and not the Desk.</p>",
